Since your scroll is blessed, it asks for a class of monster to genocide
(otherwise it justs asks which monster to genocide). In this case, you're
supposed to enter a letter (uppercase L for Liches), and all monsters
represented by that latter will be genocided (if genocidable). Had it been
uncursed, your typing "Liches" would have resulted in generic liches being
genocided.

This is all stated quite clearly in the relevant spoilers, e.g.
http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/scrl-343.txt

